flowchart TD
    subgraph Client["Player device"]
        UI["React chess UI in browser"]
    end
    subgraph Live["Single application host · Python backend"]
        UC["Practice controller"]
        DB["SQLite file · Local practice history"]
        MC["ML controller"]
        ME["ML engine · FSRS and review planner"]
        UC -->|Load opening lines or save practice results| DB
        DB -.->|Line data or write confirmation| UC
        UC -->|Request next review line| MC
        MC -.->|Selected line ID or no line available| UC
        MC -->|Read player data or save suggestion| DB
        DB -.->|Player data or write confirmation| MC
        MC -->|Request suggestion with player data| ME
        ME -.->|Selected line ID or no line due| MC
    end
    UI -->|Local HTTP request| UC
    UC -.->|Board state and feedback| UI
    subgraph Offline["Offline FSRS fitting · Separate package"]
        SC["Synthetic clients"] -->|Generate simulated practice| CSV["Synthetic practice history CSV"]
        CSV -->|Supply training data| TS["Python FSRS training script"]
        TS -->|Save fitted weights| MODEL["FSRS weights CSV"]
    end
    MODEL -->|Select weights explicitly; no automatic import| ME
